  m_Name: Carta_OnibusAutonomosEmCorredorPiloto
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "\xD4nibus Aut\xF4nomos em Corredor Piloto"
  _titleEn: Autonomous Buses on a Pilot Route
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Micro-\xF4nibus sem motorista circulam devagar em trajetos curtos e
    controlados, como testes para o transporte aut\xF4nomo."
  _summaryEn: Driverless shuttles run slowly on short, controlled routes as trials
    for autonomous transport.
  _realWorld: "A francesa Navya colocou micro-\xF4nibus aut\xF4nomos em teste em
    Lyon a partir de 2016 e depois em v\xE1rias outras cidades."
  _realWorldEn: French company Navya began trialing autonomous shuttles in Lyon in
    2016 and later in many other cities.
  _tradeOffs: "Os ve\xEDculos ainda andam devagar, muitas vezes com um operador a
    bordo, e o custo por passageiro \xE9 alto."
  _tradeOffsEn: The vehicles still run slowly, often with an operator on board, and
    the cost per passenger is high.
  _sources:
  - Label: Navya (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Navya
